# COM-4b: what every Mac release from CI is built with (.github/workflows/installers.yml, docs/UPDATES.md).
# The feed URL never changes for the life of the app. The public key is the public half of the EdDSA key whose private
# half is the SPARKLE_ED_PRIVATE_KEY secret of lordillusions/sonora (generate_keys -p prints it). Changing either strands
# every installed copy: they would never see another update.
SONORA_UPDATE_FEED_URL=https://sonoradaw.com/appcast.xml
# COM-4l: Windows (WinSparkle) and Linux (AppImage/.deb) feeds, signed with the same key in the release job.
SONORA_UPDATE_FEED_URL_WINDOWS=https://sonoradaw.com/appcast-windows.xml
SONORA_UPDATE_FEED_URL_LINUX=https://sonoradaw.com/appcast-linux.xml
SONORA_UPDATE_PUBLIC_KEY=k5ZffUC+tRT4esVUT54IBgZzK2QtIyNNYRp+6SjUj3A=
